WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:03.690
Recovery is part of performance, not a reward after performance.

00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:08.275
Constant output eventually reduces quality because attention, judgment, emotional control,

00:00:08.275 --> 00:00:09.830
and creativity all need renewal.

00:00:09.830 --> 00:00:13.580
Recovery can be short or long, active or quiet, individual or social.

00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:16.790
The important idea is that recovery belongs inside the system.

00:00:16.790 --> 00:00:20.053
If it is always postponed until everything is complete, it may never happen.

00:00:20.053 --> 00:00:22.650
Breaks create transitions that help attention reset.

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:24.710
A useful break does not have to be elaborate.

00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:28.080
It may mean stepping away from the screen, moving briefly, getting water,

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:31.045
changing posture, or closing a loop before moving to a new task.

00:00:31.045 --> 00:00:35.380
Sleep matters at a general level because people need adequate rest to sustain judgment and

00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:35.855
learning,

00:00:35.855 --> 00:00:39.390
but this course does not provide sleep treatment guidance or clinical advice.

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:40.960
Movement, hydration, nutrition,

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:44.925
and emotional decompression can all support capacity in broad practical ways.

00:00:44.925 --> 00:00:48.640
The goal is not to prescribe a diet, supplement protocol, or performance hack.

00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:52.394
It is to recognize that people do better when basic needs are not treated as optional.

00:00:52.394 --> 00:00:56.205
A demanding work system that ignores the body and emotions will eventually pay through

00:00:56.205 --> 00:00:56.745
errors,

00:00:56.745 --> 00:00:58.820
conflict, and lower-quality execution.

00:00:58.820 --> 00:01:01.220
Transitions between tasks are especially valuable.

00:01:01.220 --> 00:01:05.050
Going straight from an intense meeting into a complex decision may preserve calendar

00:01:05.050 --> 00:01:07.285
efficiency while reducing judgment quality.

00:01:07.285 --> 00:01:11.265
A short transition can capture action items, clear the workspace, reset attention,

00:01:11.265 --> 00:01:12.600
and make the next start cleaner.

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:15.530
Energy renewal is not about avoiding hard work.

00:01:15.530 --> 00:01:17.920
It is about making hard work sustainable enough to repeat.
